    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stellations is a manic arcade game about careening around mind maps. Pilot yourself through vibrating circuits where each input is tactile, twitchy, delightful. Chase, be chased, escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crispy, crunchy reactive visuals and audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frantic moment to moment gameplay set among serene constellations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adversaries of various shapes and sizes that navigate around the web</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A level editor plugged into steam workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand drawn homonculi to guide you through the mind palace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal aesthetic, maximal atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/17950d6431a8e4589eb0c0249dd82820.poster.avif?t=1740426006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/17950d6431a8e4589eb0c0249dd82820.webm?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/17950d6431a8e4589eb0c0249dd82820.mp4?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Align to the path to gain momentum and shoot off points with timed button presses. Unique points allow you to create new connections, fly between webs, and boost through intersections. Unlock new lines by collecting and depositing nodes, hitting top speed, and a little exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sound</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every point and line in Stellations reacts to your input with the shimmer and rumble of a frequency modulation synth. Each level is like an instrument you learn to play through your movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/29bda217d564479a9ba58a6f62dcae8c.poster.avif?t=1740426006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/29bda217d564479a9ba58a6f62dcae8c.webm?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/29bda217d564479a9ba58a6f62dcae8c.mp4?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/6d10610e77c5b2fdca5aa1fa3e60f9a3.poster.avif?t=1740426006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/6d10610e77c5b2fdca5aa1fa3e60f9a3.webm?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/6d10610e77c5b2fdca5aa1fa3e60f9a3.mp4?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Level Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw your thought loops in the level editor and navigate them. Decorate them with different line types, textures, words, and entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/727eed7d693aa93e4b5acf943ab619f4.poster.avif?t=1740426006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/727eed7d693aa93e4b5acf943ab619f4.webm?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/727eed7d693aa93e4b5acf943ab619f4.mp4?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stellations is a manic arcade game about careening around mind maps. Pilot yourself through vibrating circuits where each input is tactile, twitchy, delightful. Chase, be chased, escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crispy, crunchy reactive visuals and audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frantic moment to moment gameplay set among serene constellations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adversaries of various shapes and sizes that navigate around the web</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A level editor plugged into steam workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand drawn homonculi to guide you through the mind palace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal aesthetic, maximal atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/17950d6431a8e4589eb0c0249dd82820.poster.avif?t=1740426006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/17950d6431a8e4589eb0c0249dd82820.webm?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/17950d6431a8e4589eb0c0249dd82820.mp4?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Align to the path to gain momentum and shoot off points with timed button presses. Unique points allow you to create new connections, fly between webs, and boost through intersections. Unlock new lines by collecting and depositing nodes, hitting top speed, and a little exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sound</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every point and line in Stellations reacts to your input with the shimmer and rumble of a frequency modulation synth. Each level is like an instrument you learn to play through your movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/29bda217d564479a9ba58a6f62dcae8c.poster.avif?t=1740426006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/29bda217d564479a9ba58a6f62dcae8c.webm?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/29bda217d564479a9ba58a6f62dcae8c.mp4?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/6d10610e77c5b2fdca5aa1fa3e60f9a3.poster.avif?t=1740426006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/6d10610e77c5b2fdca5aa1fa3e60f9a3.webm?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/6d10610e77c5b2fdca5aa1fa3e60f9a3.mp4?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Level Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw your thought loops in the level editor and navigate them. Decorate them with different line types, textures, words, and entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/727eed7d693aa93e4b5acf943ab619f4.poster.avif?t=1740426006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/727eed7d693aa93e4b5acf943ab619f4.webm?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648200/extras/727eed7d693aa93e4b5acf943ab619f4.mp4?t=1740426006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
